facts.statement:
以下は原DOMと適用CSSから構成した通常表示の非実行投影である。「職員番号表示値」「職員氏名表示値」は差込位置を示し、実在職員の値やBean初期値ではない。送信先と識別値はdata属性へ残し、全ボタンをtype=button、JavaScriptなし、実送信actionなしとする。
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>年金自動受取予約管理システム</title><style>
:root{--bg:#edf1f4;--surface:#ffffff;--line:#b8c2cc;--text:#18212a;--nav:#16324a;--nav-text:#f4f8fb;--primary-dark:#0a5148;--button:#e8edf1;--button-border:#7b8792;--focus:#1a75bb;--work-screen-width:1180px}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}button,input{margin:0;font:inherit}button,[type="button"]{cursor:pointer}button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus);outline-offset:1px}html{min-height:100%}body{min-height:100vh;margin:0;color:var(--text);background:var(--bg);font-family:"Yu Gothic UI","Meiryo","Segoe UI",sans-serif}
.app-shell{width:100%;max-width:1440px;margin-inline:auto}.app-nav{display:flex;min-height:48px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:7px 18px;color:var(--nav-text);background:var(--nav);border-bottom:1px solid #0c2236}.app-nav__title{color:var(--nav-text);font-weight:800;line-height:1.25}.nav-button{min-height:32px;padding:4px 12px;color:var(--nav-text);background:#294a64;border:1px solid #8da3b5;border-radius:3px;font-weight:700}.nav-button:hover,.nav-button:focus{background:#365f7d;border-color:#ffffff}
main.app-shell:not(.login-shell){padding:20px 18px 52px}.surface{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(16,32,48,.08)}.screen{padding:18px}.screen:not(.lookup-screen-popup){max-width:var(--work-screen-width);margin-right:auto;margin-left:auto}.screen-header{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:18px;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.screen-header-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:flex-end}h1{margin:0;font-size:1.45rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0}
.staff-badge{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto auto auto;gap:8px;align-items:center;min-height:34px;padding:6px 10px;background:#eef7f5;border:1px solid #9fc3bc;border-radius:4px;color:var(--primary-dark)}.staff-badge strong{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.menu-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(260px,396px);gap:20px;align-items:stretch;justify-content:center;max-width:396px;margin:48px auto 0}.access-button{display:inline-flex;min-height:42px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:8px 18px;color:var(--text);background:var(--button);border:1px solid var(--button-border);border-radius:4px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;line-height:1.2}.access-button:hover,.access-button:focus{color:var(--text);background:#dce5eb;border-color:var(--focus)}
@media(max-width:960px){.menu-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media(max-width:640px){.screen-header{display:grid}.menu-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style></head><body>
<header class="app-nav"><div class="app-nav__title">年金自動受取予約管理システム</div><form data-action="{contextPath}/Action.do" data-http-method="POST"><input type="hidden" name="FUNCTION_ID" value="common"><input type="hidden" name="VIEW_ID" value="Logout"><input type="hidden" name="COMMAND_ID" value=""><button class="nav-button" type="button">ログアウト</button></form></header>
<main class="app-shell"><section class="screen surface menu-screen"><div class="screen-header"><h1>年金自動受取予約管理システム</h1><div class="screen-header-actions"><div class="staff-badge"><span>ログイン職員</span><strong>〈職員番号表示値〉</strong><span>〈職員氏名表示値〉</span></div></div></div>
<form id="menuForm" data-action="{contextPath}/Action.do" data-http-method="POST"><input type="hidden" name="FUNCTION_ID" value="nenkin"><input id="menuView" type="hidden" name="VIEW_ID" value="Menu"><input id="menuCommand" type="hidden" name="COMMAND_ID" value="View"><div class="menu-grid"><button class="access-button" type="button" data-view-id="Pension" data-command-id="View">新規・変更・削除</button><button class="access-button" type="button" data-view-id="Batch" data-command-id="View">処理データ</button><button class="access-button" type="button" data-view-id="Report" data-command-id="View">印刷</button><button class="access-button" type="button" data-view-id="Excel" data-command-id="View">EXCEL出力</button></div></form>
</section></main></body></html>
